 "procedures": [
  {
   "title": "Pre-ride check (T-CLOCS)",
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "Tyres and wheels: pressures cold, tread depth across the width, no cuts, bulges or nails; wheels true with no cracks.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "tyre_f",
      "tyre_r",
      "rim_f",
      "rim_r"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Controls: levers and pedals move freely and return; the throttle snaps shut on its own with the bars at full lock both ways.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "handlebar",
      "brake_pedal",
      "gear_lever"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Lights and electrics: both headlamps high and low, tail and brake lamp from both brakes, all four indicators, horn.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "headlamps",
      "tail_lamp",
      "indicators_front",
      "indicators_rear"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Oil and coolant: engine oil level on level ground with the bike upright, no leaks from the cases; coolant between the marks, hoses firm.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "crankcase",
      "sump",
      "radiator",
      "coolant_hoses"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Chassis: fork seals dry, the shock not leaking; chain slack within the figure, the chain lubed, sprocket teeth not hooked.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "fork",
      "rear_shock",
      "chain",
      "sprocket_r",
      "sprocket_front"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Stand: the side stand springs fully up on its own and holds the bike when down.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "side_stand"
     ],
     "open": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Brakes",
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "Front: two discs, a radial caliper on each fork leg; pads thicker than the wear line, the discs smooth with no deep scoring or blueing.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "caliper_front",
      "disc_f"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Rear: the same check at the rear caliper and disc; the pedal firm, not spongy.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "caliper_rear",
      "disc_r",
      "brake_pedal"
     ],
     "open": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Under the fairing",
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "Take off the side panels: the radiator sits behind the front wheel, the exhaust headers run down in front of the engine.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "fairing_left",
      "fairing_right",
      "radiator",
      "exhaust_headers"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Four cylinders in one block lean forward; the head and the cam cover sit on top, a coil on each spark plug.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "cylinder_block",
      "cylinder_head",
      "cam_cover",
      "spark_plugs"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "Air comes in through the airbox under the tank and four throttle bodies into the back of the head.",
     "view": "part",
     "parts": [
      "airbox",
      "throttle_bodies",
      "tank"
     ],
     "open": []
    },
    {
     "text": "The clutch sits behind its cover on the right, the alternator behind its cover on the left; the oil filter is at the front, low down.",
